OL,3,GNEWSANHS speeds up tests and brings
OL,4,Athem closer to home
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn NHS centre has opened to bring
OL,7,Fpatients faster access to vital tests
OL,8,Fcloser to where people live.
OL,10,FThe Community Diagnostic Centre (CDC)
OL,11,Fin Portsmouth aims to speed up
OL,12,Fdiagnosis and treatment.
OL,14,FIt is part of the governments 10-year
OL,15,Fplan to relieve pressure on hospitals.
OL,17,FThe community focused centre is a
OL,18,Fpartnership between Portsmouth
OL,19,FHospitals University NHS Trust (PHU)
OL,20,Fand the company Alliance Medical (AML).
